## ===================================================================
## vvPlayer - Git 忽略规则 (.gitignore)
## 针对 .NET / WPF / Visual Studio / Rider / 大体积媒体与模型定制
## ===================================================================

# 1. 编译输出与中间缓存 (极其重要，杜绝上传)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
publish/
*.zip
[Aa]pp[Dd]ata/
out/
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/

# 2. 本地音视频测试文件与媒体资源 (>100MB 会被 GitHub 强行拒推)
test/
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.avi
*.mov
*.wmv
*.flv
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.flac
*.m4a

# 3. 离线 AI 模型权重文件 (Whisper / ONNX 权重通常数以百兆，应在首次运行自动下载或外链存储)
Assets/opus-mt-en-zh/
Assets/*.bin
Assets/*.onnx
Assets/**/vocab.json
Assets/**/tokenizer.json
*.onnx
*.bin
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.gguf
models/
whisper_models/

# 4. Visual Studio / VS Code / JetBrains Rider 工具及个人环境配置
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.user
*.userosv
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.DotSettings.user
*.pidb
*.ide

# 5. 临时文件、崩溃日志与转储
*.log
crash.log
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*~
*.dmp
*.bak

# 6. Windows / macOS 操作系统临时文件
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# 7. NuGet 本地包缓存 (依赖会通过 nuget.config 与 csproj 自动还原)
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
